  (text "PCM5102A 3-wire mode: SCK=GND; FMT=LOW (I2S); FLT=LOW; DEMP=LOW. No external MCLK is required." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "090000b3-9000-4900-8900-0000000000b4"))
  (text "XSMT defaults LOW via 100k pulldown. Firmware starts stable BCLK/LRCK/DATA, waits, then drives DAC_XSMT HIGH." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 135 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "090000b4-9000-4900-8900-0000000000b5"))
  (text "Single 3V3_AUDIO supply for CPVDD/DVDD/AVDD. LDOO is an internal ~1.8V output and is decoupled only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "090000b5-9000-4900-8900-0000000000b6"))
  (text "MAIN_L/R are ground-centered DirectPath line outputs: 470R + 2.2nF, no series DC-block capacitors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "090000b6-9000-4900-8900-0000000000b7"))
  (text "RCA and optional 3.5mm mechanical footprints remain TBD-MECH. J_LINE_35 is DNP and is LINE OUT only, not headphone drive." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "090000b7-9000-4900-8900-0000000000b8"))
